      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "panel",
        "shape": "rectangle"
      },
      "text": "Task Detail Panel"
    },
    {
      "id": "task-files",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 330,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "file-system",
        "shape": "rectangle"
      },
      "text": "backlog/tasks/*.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-lifecycle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "LIFECYCLE FLOW:\n\n1. User clicks issue → issue:selected event\n2. PanelContext fetches timeline + updates state\n3. EditorLayout focuses issue-detail panel\n4. User clicks 'Push to Backlog' → issue:push-to-backlog\n5. Build task markdown from issue metadata\n6. Append to backlog.md + commit\n7. Emit issue:task-created\n8. Task appears in Kanban panel\n9. User manages task (status, priority, deps)\n10. Updates persist to backlog/tasks/*.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-api-routes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "API ROUTES:\n\n• GET /api/.../issues\n  → List issues (paginated, filtered)\n\n• GET /api/.../issues/[number]\n  → Issue details\n\n• GET /api/.../issues/[number]/timeline\n  → Timeline events + review comments\n\n• POST /api/.../issues/[number]\n  → Add comment"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "STATE SLICES (PanelContext):\n\n• issuesData: owner, repo, issues[], authStatus\n• messagesData: target, timeline[], reviewComments[]\n• Backlog: Managed via @backlog-md/core\n  - parseTaskMarkdown()\n  - serializeTaskMarkdown()"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-task-format",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "TASK METADATA:\n\n• Status: triage/todo/in-progress/done/blocked\n• Priority: high/medium/low (from issue labels)\n• Labels: Inherited from issue\n• Dependencies: Task relationships\n• References: GitHub issue URL, owner/repo#number\n• Anchor: gh-issue-{number}"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "github-issues-panel",
      "toNode": "issue-selected-event",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "user clicks issue",
      "pv": {
        "edgeType": "user-action"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
